{"id":"12045dd8fa450631","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md","title":"Exterior Algebra","display":"df-exterior-algebra — Exterior Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-exterior-algebra","aliases":["58-df-exterior-algebra"],"display":"df-exterior-algebra — Exterior Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-exterior-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-exterior-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exterior-algebra — Exterior Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\\)</span> (vector space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,I,\\Lambda,K,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V\">\\(T,I,\\Lambda,K,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V\\)</span> (tensor algebra carrier, alternating ideal, quotient, field, and vector-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exterior\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S(\\Lambda,T,I,K,V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land I=\\left\\langle\\{v\\otimes v:v\\in V\\}\\right\\rangle_T\\land\\Lambda=T/I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exterior\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S(\\Lambda,T,I,K,V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land I=\\left\\langle\\{v\\otimes v:v\\in V\\}\\right\\rangle_T\\land\\Lambda=T/I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exterior algebra is the quotient of supplied tensor-algebra data by the explicitly supplied ideal generated by all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\otimes v\">\\(v\\otimes v\\)</span>; no ambient tensor algebra is left as an unbound term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)$ (vector space, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"T,I,\\Lambda,K,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exterior\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ExteriorAlgebraStructure}_S(\\Lambda,T,I,K,V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land I=\\left\\langle\\{v\\otimes v:v\\in V\\}\\right\\rangle_T\\land\\Lambda=T/I","display":true},{"tex":"v\\otimes v","display":false}],"bytes":1096,"backlinks":[{"id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bcbbb5818d2f6100","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-511","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md|58-df-exterior-algebra]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}